flowchart TD
    A[Pipe IPC] --> B[Unidirectional]
    A --> C[pipe system call]
    
    C --> D["int fd[2], pipe(fd)"]
    D --> E["fd[0] = read end"]
    D --> F["fd[1] = write end"]
    
    G[Parent] --> H[fork]
    H --> I[Child]
    
    G --> J["close(fd[0]), Keep write end"]
    I --> K["close(fd[1]), Keep read end"]
    
    J --> L["write(fd[1], data, size)"]
    K --> M["read(fd[0], buf, size)"]
    
    L -.Data flow.-> M
    
    N[FIFO Named Pipe] --> O["mkfifo(/tmp/mypipe, 0666)"]
    O --> P[Unrelated processes can open]
    P --> Q[Process A: open for write]
    P --> R[Process B: open for read]
    
    style L fill:#e8f5e8
    style M fill:#e1f5ff
    style O fill:#fff4e1
